{"File":"c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google Antigravity/Projects/Typikon Coded/.agents/references/learnings.md","LineNumber":480,"LineContent":"   - Fixed a bug where simple saints falling on moveable feasts (e.g. Pascha, Ascension, Pentecost) overrode the feast's rank code. Added `39` (Ascension), `49` (Pentecost), and `60` (Eucharist) to the `movable_overrides` map in `_lookup_dolnytsky_calendar`."}
