{"File":"c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google Antigravity/Projects/Typikon Coded/.agents/references/learnings.md","LineNumber":519,"LineContent":"   - Multiple separate commemorations sharing a single rank tag in the raw calendar source must never be merged into a single description in [calendar_dolnytsky.json](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/json_db/calendar_dolnytsky.json). Doing so creates \"super person\" saints (e.g., December 4 St. Barbara \u0026 St. John of Damascus) and causes logic failures."}
